These guys are a really awesome band. I originally heard them on Triple J and instantly
fell in love. This song is basically just 4 chords the whole way through.. simple to play.
If you play the trumpet, the melody's simple to figure out. There's no guitar.. but it
still sounds ok... Good fun to improvise over as well.. basically have fun with it.

Ok.. here's the chords:

Dm    Bb    F    Am7... and that's it..

